  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.1 (forks 2.3.8) - TRIM SAFE, enforced: ILGPU, ILGPU.Algorithms and SpawnDev.ILGPU are IsTrimmable and every trim warning is a build error; the full test suite passes on a TRIMMED publish. Blazor WASM AOT is supported with WasmStripILAfterAOT=false (see Docs/limitations.md). Fixes: bool kernel scalar parameters on all 6 backends; WebGL ulong scalars; float/double % exact on every backend; PTX bitcast of a constant; WebGPU dispatch host cost (single compute pass per batch, in-place scalar packing). WebGL worker messages are typed DTOs.",
